  "selected_clauses": [
    {
      "id": 461,
      "start": 937.02,
      "end": 938.12,
      "text": "这是我们今天的新款",
      "members": [
        461
      ],
      "group": 0,
      "role": "hook",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 462,
      "start": 939.82,
      "end": 941.64,
      "text": "它是一款醋酸面料的小上衣",
      "members": [
        462
      ],
      "group": 0,
      "role": "hook",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 22.64,
      "end": 26.42,
      "text": "它会把你整个人的脖颈这里有圆领的感觉,但是还有一个小威领的设计。",
      "members": [
        4
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 29.8,
      "end": 31.56,
      "text": "它是收腰的同时它不夸张",
      "members": [
        7
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 36.96,
      "end": 41.96,
      "text": "特别有贺本的那样的一个味道就非常的欧洲非常非常的法系的感觉",
      "members": [
        12,
        13,
        14
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 61.38,
      "end": 68.04,
      "text": "它是用醋酸面料来做的没有用其他的任何面料如果是用羊毛面料来做这款面料它打不到这个白度",
      "members": [
        28,
        29,
        30,
        31
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 70.14,
      "end": 75.24,
      "text": "因为羊毛无法漂白它只有那种奶奶的白所以这一件我要做的是那种纯白的感觉",
      "members": [
        33,
        34,
        35
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "start": 236.87,
      "end": 241.07,
      "text": "我们今年在各种工艺细节还有版型上面又做了再次升级",
      "members": [
        115,
        116
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "start": 241.69,
      "end": 245.69,
      "text": "所有的东西都会跟去年更不一样为的就是要让你穿出质感",
      "members": [
        117,
        118
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "start": 312.3,
      "end": 315.82,
      "text": "肩膀这个地方它是可以很漂亮的给到你这个正肩感的",
      "members": [
        143
      ],
      "group": 4,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 594.67,
      "end": 600.15,
      "text": "气质一定是坚强决定的我告诉你这女生再漂亮肩膀斜方肌很重你会觉得她没气质",
      "members": [
        288,
        289,
        290
      ],
      "group": 4,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 601.83,
      "end": 606.27,
      "text": "所以好的衣服就是要用她的版型来掩盖住你身形上的缺陷对不对",
      "members": [
        292,
        293
      ],
      "group": 4,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "start": 153.74,
      "end": 156.24,
      "text": "它是小薄型的白的黑的两个色",
      "members": [
        82
      ],
      "group": 5,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 490,
      "start": 1000.74,
      "end": 1001.76,
      "text": "但黑色确实显瘦",
      "members": [
        490
      ],
      "group": 5,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "start": 158.94,
      "end": 160.38,
      "text": "白色超级气质",
      "members": [
        84
      ],
      "group": 5,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 81.38,
      "end": 83.08,
      "text": "解开扣子其实你就当外套来穿",
      "members": [
        39
      ],
      "group": 6,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 572.62,
      "end": 573.84,
      "text": "我里面是什么都没穿的",
      "members": [
        274
      ],
      "group": 6,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 574.64,
      "end": 576.72,
      "text": "你里面就随便整个小雕刀拉小背心拉",
      "members": [
        276
      ],
      "group": 6,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 468,
      "start": 952.08,
      "end": 954.68,
      "text": "你现在空调房就能穿然后一直能穿到秋天",
      "members": [
        468,
        469
      ],
      "group": 6,
      "role": "styling",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "start": 225.27,
      "end": 229.31,
      "text": "如果你穿一件T恤跟你穿一件这种短外套的话你的状态跟其实是真的不一样的",
      "members": [
        110,
        111
      ],
      "group": 7,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "start": 282.63,
      "end": 284.69,
      "text": "而且它整一个的肩膀你自己感受一下它",
      "members": [
        133
      ],
      "group": 7,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "start": 285.29,
      "end": 288.45,
      "text": "要腰伸有腰伸你腰粗的人穿上去秒变小S腰",
      "members": [
        134
      ],
      "group": 7,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 43.08,
      "end": 46.76,
      "text": "我觉得不用去说什么好看高级很贵气",
      "members": [
        16,
        17,
        18
      ],
      "group": 7,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 395,
      "start": 792.88,
      "end": 801.68,
      "text": "所以它非常非常的适合我们在一些微微的需要有一点点整个人的那种气质的时候去穿它它会给你这个人的气质加分不少的",
      "members": [
        395,
        396,
        397
      ],
      "group": 8,
      "role": "scene",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 435,
      "start": 869.14,
      "end": 871.82,
      "text": "就这种东西其实就是非常非常显气质的",
      "members": [
        435
      ],
      "group": 9,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 437,
      "start": 878.0,
      "end": 881.02,
      "text": "就会把你整个人的女性的那种气质穿得非常美的一件外套",
      "members": [
        437
      ],
      "group": 9,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 554.46,
      "end": 556.72,
      "text": "你们自己感受一下它的版型超级美",
      "members": [
        263
      ],
      "group": 9,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 47.66,
      "end": 49.7,
      "text": "区别于你所有所有的外套的感觉看一下",
      "members": [
        20
      ],
      "group": 9,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 488,
      "start": 998.26,
      "end": 999.54,
      "text": "让你感觉到有设计感一点",
      "members": [
        488
      ],
      "group": 10,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 570.44,
      "end": 572.62,
      "text": "然后你能看到的是它这里的一个特殊感",
      "members": [
        273
      ],
      "group": 10,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 465,
      "start": 947.3,
      "end": 948.92,
      "text": "他整个的版型是非常氧气的",
      "members": [
        465
      ],
      "group": 10,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "start": 616.29,
      "end": 618.41,
      "text": "我就是要让你看到比较真实的泽泽",
      "members": [
        302
      ],
      "group": 11,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "start": 618.95,
      "end": 624.25,
      "text": "我的身材就是比较真实我现在接近110斤的体重我现在这个个子我110斤屁股大腿粗",
      "members": [
        303,
        304,
        305
      ],
      "group": 11,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 306,
      "start": 624.83,
      "end": 630.41,
      "text": "所以你能感受到的是你有任何这样缺陷的人通过我们衣服的版型也是可以把你穿得很美的对吧",
      "members": [
        306,
        307,
        308,
        309
      ],
      "group": 11,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 77.2,
      "end": 79.0,
      "text": "整个衣服又薄又有成度",
      "members": [
        37
      ],
      "group": 12,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 503,
